d 'CELLGRAPH': module to collapse data to cell level and graph the results
d
d    Data is collapsed to cell level, where cells are defined by
d one or two categorical variables (byvar1 and byvar2) and cell   
d means (or other statistics) of a third variable (varname) are
d graphed. 
d
d KW: data management
d KW: cells
d KW: collapse
d KW: graphics
d
d Requires: Stata version 18
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260827
d
d Author: Johannes Schmieder,  Boston University
d Support: email johannes@@bu.edu
d
f cellgraph.ado
f cellgraph_run.ado
f cellgraph.sthlp
